            <ArticleTitle>The extrapolation of attributable risk to new populations.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>717-25</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>I develop a method for extrapolation of attributable risk estimated from one population, to other populations with a different rate of risk factor exposure and/or rate of outcome. The method uses the relationship between attributable risk and the product moment correlation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
